  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 63900ac93b90d764abfce22b4b5e61b6, type: 3}
  m_Name: cutSceneStart
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speaker: Ryan
    text: Desa karang Turi...
    pfp: {fileID: -8503444539322447447, guid: 717fe866f10db74429e9a9133c64ab34, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 6799216245798168510, guid: 9c671fba460bbea47a2d5e138ebd0e7c, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ryan
    text: "Krisis air Bersih\u2026 tapi hasil panen mereka nomor satu di kabupaten
      ini."
    pfp: {fileID: 3184939432797331818, guid: 717fe866f10db74429e9a9133c64ab34, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 6799216245798168510, guid: 9c671fba460bbea47a2d5e138ebd0e7c, type: 3}
  - speaker: Bima
    text: Kok bisa sih, tempat kek gitu tuh biasanya nggak normal, Yan.
    pfp: {fileID: 3184939432797331818, guid: 717fe866f10db74429e9a9133c64ab34, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 8257921945241284986, guid: db888c91a081ccf4a93006176e280c5e, type: 3}
  - speaker: Tari
    text: Justru itu. ini bukan sekadar konten, kita bisa cari tau kok bisa gitu.
    pfp: {fileID: 3184939432797331818, guid: 717fe866f10db74429e9a9133c64ab34, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 8257921945241284986, guid: db888c91a081ccf4a93006176e280c5e, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ryan
    text: Kalau teknologi filter ini berhasil dan masalah pangan ini diketahui kita
      bisa bantu lebih banyak tempat
    pfp: {fileID: 3184939432797331818, guid: 717fe866f10db74429e9a9133c64ab34, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: -4748702184737024587, guid: f39f245b36ce7a641992732b5266bb2a, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ryan
    text: ni jadi langkah awal kita.
    pfp: {fileID: 3184939432797331818, guid: 717fe866f10db74429e9a9133c64ab34, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: -4748702184737024587, guid: f39f245b36ce7a641992732b5266bb2a, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ryan
    text: Sekalian Kita liburan, katanya desanya juga asri
    pfp: {fileID: 3184939432797331818, guid: 717fe866f10db74429e9a9133c64ab34, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: -4748702184737024587, guid: f39f245b36ce7a641992732b5266bb2a, type: 3}
